# Testing

## Framework

- No GTest / Catch2. Tests are custom C++ executables registered with CTest.
- Register via `ADD_TEST_TARGET` / `ADD_TEST_EXEC` in `cmake/Utils.cmake`.
- Fail with non-zero exit / clear stderr messages (see `tests/libswcdb_core/`).
- Tests/examples only when `SWC_BUILD_PKG` is empty.

## Layout

| Kind | Paths | Needs install + `swcdb_cluster`? | Default CI (`TEST=1`) |
|------|-------|----------------------------------|------------------------|
| Unit | `tests/libswcdb_core/`, `tests/libswcdb/` | No | Yes (matrix subset) |
| Integration | `tests/integration/{client,comm,fs,manager,ranger,broker,thrift,utils}/` | Yes | No (`TEST=2` only) |

Golden output: `tests/testutils/testdiff` vs `.golden` files (needs host `diff` / `diffutils`).

## Smoke configure (CI-like)

Sibling `builds/swcdb`, prefix `/opt/swcdb`, shared linking, no bindings:

```bash
cmake ../swc-db \
  -DO_LEVEL=3 -DSWC_IMPL_SOURCE=OFF \
  -DBUILD_LINKING=SHARED \
  -DSWC_LANGUAGES=NONE \
  -DWITHOUT_THRIFT_C=ON \
  -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/swcdb
```

See `docs/build/configure/` for the full example.

## Running

```bash
# Prefer while developing:
ctest -R libswcdb_core --output-on-failure

make test
# or: ctest --output-on-failure in the build tree
```

Integration prerequisites: `make install`, writable data dirs, passwordless SSH for `swcdb_cluster`. Before retest: `swcdb_cluster stop` then `kill` if needed (leftover PIDs hang `wait_ready`). Prefer unit tests under `libswcdb*` for local changes; extend integration only when cluster behavior is involved.

ThriftBroker exit 127 / missing `libthrift*.so*`: RPATH is `${PREFIX}/lib` only — see `docs/install/dependencies/` (runtime Thrift libs) or `-DSWC_INSTALL_DEP_LIBS=ON`.
